Group: DTCC - Corporate Action Transformation
Collection: DTCC - US - CA - Payment Processing - SR 2025
Usage Guideline: Corporate Action Movement Confirmation seev.036.001.16
Base Message: seev.036.001.16
Date of publication: 08 August 2025
URL: https://www2.swift.com/mystandards/#/mp/mx/a5b1036a617a75e365c0ae680a82f9b3/a68a8a38a54c9e0e7cbffde3376cf1c2
Description: Used to notify of a payment made on a corporate action event. Separate messages will be sent for payments based on position capture date balance, stock loan balance, repurchase agreements balance (REPOs) and failed trades (Fails) balance. Also as an exception, in some scenarios a reversal is not possible and payment / withdrawal is made as an adjustment using this message.
Generated by the MyStandards web platform [https://www.swift.com/mystandards] on 2025-08-08T19:40:09Z
-->
