Description: Used to pre advice of the upcoming payment. Separate messages will be sent for payments based on position capture date balance, stock loan balance, repurchase agreements balance (REPOs) and failed trades (Fails) balance.
Generated by the MyStandards web platform [https://www.swift.com/mystandards] on 2025-09-24T12:52:12Z
