                    <xs:documentation source="Definition" xml:lang="EN">The actual interest rate before tax used for the payment of the interest for the specified interest period. &#13;
Usage guideline: It is used to provide the applicable rate for the current payment, after all calculations have been performed, that is, application of period and method of interest computation.</xs:documentation>
